  "source_code": "MOD = 998244353\r\nN = 200001\r\n\r\ninv = [0, 1] + [0] * (N - 1)\r\nfor i in range(2, N + 1):\r\n    inv[i] = (MOD - (MOD // i) * inv[MOD % i] % MOD) % MOD\r\n    \r\nH = [0] * (N + 1)\r\nfor i in range(1, N + 1):\r\n    H[i] = (H[i - 1] + inv[i]) % MOD \r\n\r\nfor _ in range(int(input())):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = list(map(int, input().split()))\r\n    \r\n    res = 0 \r\n    \r\n    for j in range(1, n + 1):\r\n        res += a[j - 1] * (H[j - 1] + H[n - j])\r\n    \r\n    print(res % MOD)",
